\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Network structures. (a) MGD-Former: a four-stage MiT-B2 encoder; the 1/32 feature is fused successively with 1/16, 1/8, and 1/4 features, producing stride 4; three auxiliary heads attach at 1/4, 1/8, and 1/16. (b) The four baselines: symmetric UNet skips, Attention U-Net gating, WRCANet's RCAB enhancement backbone with a three-level U head, and MGD-PriorNet's FCAS/ASAB/APG-DD.}}{12}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:networks}{{3}{12}{Network structures. (a) MGD-Former: a four-stage MiT-B2 encoder; the 1/32 feature is fused successively with 1/16, 1/8, and 1/4 features, producing stride 4; three auxiliary heads attach at 1/4, 1/8, and 1/16. (b) The four baselines: symmetric UNet skips, Attention U-Net gating, WRCANet's RCAB enhancement backbone with a three-level U head, and MGD-PriorNet's FCAS/ASAB/APG-DD}{figure.caption.4}{}}
